   217	    Summarize reachable colored token layers inside the 3x3 block around the unique red center.
   218	
   219	    Input structure:
   220	    - Orange floor and optional magenta walls surround a fixed green 3x3 destination whose center is red.
   221	    - Single-pixel source tokens of several non-structural colors are scattered on floor cells outside that block.
